sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant V as Player view (sandboxed iframe)
    participant H as Host
    participant L as MCP endpoint /playback/mcp
    participant P as play_episode handler
    participant M as Media service
    U->>V: Press Play
    Note over V: player.prepare() runs inside the click.<br/>Then the view creates an ES256 key pair.
    V->>H: callServerTool play_episode<br/>arguments: episodeId<br/>_meta: public key only
    H->>L: POST tools/call with bearer token
    Note over L: Body size, bearer token, playback:play scope,<br/>then tool name and argument bounds
    L->>P: episodeId + verified account
    Note over P: Usable public key in _meta?<br/>Account entitled to this episode now?
    P->>M: issue(account, episode, key thumbprint)
    M-->>P: capability, expires in 60 s
    P-->>V: Result via host<br/>content: "Playback authorized."<br/>_meta: mediaUrl, capability, expiresAt
    Note over V: Accept only the selected episode,<br/>the pinned sign-in and its media path
    V->>M: GET /playback/media/episodeId<br/>capability + newly signed proof
    Note over M: Capability, proof and current<br/>entitlement checked again
    M-->>V: 200 audio bytes, 403 refused, or 503 try again
    Note over V: Decode and start.<br/>Show Playing once the audio clock advances.
